msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/parameterEntityFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:parameterEntity, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:parameterEntity, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/parameterEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:parameterEntityFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:parameterEntity ."
msgstr "gmeow:parameterEntityFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:parameterEntity ."

